     ("Sonning moduli va amallar",
      "Sonning moduli |a| — son o'qida a nuqtaning 0 dan masofasi: |5| = 5; |−5| = 5; |0| = 0. Modul hech qachon manfiy emas. Qo'shish: bir xil ishorali sonlarda modullari qo'shilib, umumiy ishora qo'yiladi: (−3) + (−4) = −7; turli ishorali sonlarda modullari ayriladi (kattadan kichik), ishora moduli katta sonniki: (−7) + 3 = −4. Ayirish — qarama-qarshi sonni qo'shish: 5 − 8 = 5 + (−8) = −3; 3 − (−2) = 5. Ko'paytirish va bo'lishda: ishoralar bir xil → musbat, har xil → manfiy: (−2)(−3) = 6; (−2)·3 = −6; (−12) : 4 = −3."),
     ("Daraja",
      "aⁿ = a · a · ... · a (n marta); a — asos, n — daraja ko'rsatkichi. a¹ = a; a⁰ = 1 (a ≠ 0); a⁻ⁿ = 1/aⁿ. Xossalar: aᵐ · aⁿ = aᵐ⁺ⁿ; aᵐ : aⁿ = aᵐ⁻ⁿ; (aᵐ)ⁿ = aᵐⁿ; (ab)ⁿ = aⁿbⁿ; (a/b)ⁿ = aⁿ/bⁿ. Masalan, 2³ · 2⁴ = 2⁷ = 128; 3⁵ : 3² = 27; (2³)² = 64. Manfiy asosning juft darajasi musbat ((−2)⁴ = 16), toq darajasi manfiy ((−2)³ = −8). −2⁴ = −(2⁴) = −16 (qavssiz). Kvadratlar: 1, 4, 9, 16, 25, 36, 49, 64, 81, 100, 121, 144; kublar: 1, 8, 27, 64, 125, 216."),
